result: PackageId now propagates HIR -> MIR. mir::Program carries pkg_id:Option<PkgId>
  + module_pkgs (copied from hir::Program); mir::Function gained pkg_id:Option<PkgId>,
  assigned in lower_program via prog.owner_pkg_id(f.name) so each lowered function
  (including methods, trait-impl methods, actor handlers) is attributed to its owning
  package. Function::new and verify.rs literals updated. 2 HIR->MIR propagation tests
  added; 309 lib tests pass; zero-warning release build; no new regressions (column_*
  failures pre-existing). Foundation for codegen mangling 2-32-3-11.
description: Propagate PackageId identity from HIR into MIR lowering. Done when MIR
  carries PackageId identity for symbols and MIR lowering tests confirm correct propagation.
  Depends on HIR threading subtask.
